@startuml
' Figure 44.7  Temporary autonomy widening as a signed change
' Reading order: top to bottom, Thursday, September 10, 2026 (CDT).
' The operations duty manager asks for the rule through Rachel's
' deputy; Rachel signs the rule's digest from Washington at 2:52 p.m.
' with a 12-hour expiry; the policy engine runs the bundle in shadow
' at 2:55 and active at 3:05; the reconciler samples refund error
' under the rule; the rule expires at 3:05 a.m. on its own.
' From golive.record.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Ops" as K <<org>>
participant "Rachel" as R <<policy>>
participant "Engine" as P <<policy>>
participant "Check" as V <<verified>>
K -> R : Ask, via deputy
R -> P : Sign, 12 h
P -> P : Shadow 2:55
P -> P : Active 3:05
V -> P : Error sample
P -> P : Expires 3:05 a.m.
@enduml
